sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as 🧑 User
    participant Gateway as 🌐 API Gateway
    participant CRM as 🔗 CRM Connector
    participant Scenario as 🎭 Scenario Generator
    participant Orchestrator as 🕹 Simulation Orchestrator
    participant AIChat as 🤖 Text Chat AI
    participant Voice as 🔊 Voice/Video Comms
    participant Feedback as 📝 Feedback Engine
    participant Analytics as 📊 Analytics
    participant RQ as 🟩 RabbitMQ (Events)

    User->>Gateway: Start training
    Gateway->>CRM: Fetch CRM context
    CRM-->>Gateway: CRM insights
    Gateway->>Scenario: Generate scenario
    Scenario-->>Gateway: Scenario template
    Gateway->>Orchestrator: Create session

    loop Multi-turn conversation
        User->>Gateway: Speak/type
        Gateway->>Orchestrator: Forward input
        Orchestrator->>AIChat: Get AI response
        AIChat-->>Orchestrator: Response
        Orchestrator-->>Voice: Convert to speech (if needed)
        Voice-->>User: Spoken response
    end

    Orchestrator-->>RQ: Emit simulation.completed
    RQ-->>Feedback: simulation.completed
    Feedback-->>RQ: feedback.ready
    RQ-->>Analytics: Consume all events
    Feedback-->>User: Personalized feedback
    Analytics-->>User: Updated dashboard
